WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
You are watching a cube. Which square is nearest?

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
For some observers, the apparent depth reverses.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The ink never moved. Your interpretation did.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Necker described a reversible figure in 1832.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Eye movements and intention can matter. Neither explains everything.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Experience is evidence of experience. Test the explanation.
